/S /H2
/T (Each campus or departmental administrator is responsible for administering and overseeing their budget, which is controlled on an organizational basis. This includes achieving the targets adopted as part of the budget and monitoring departmental budgets for compliance with spending limitations. Campus and departmental administrators may transfer allocations within function codes through budget transfers approved by the appropriate administrator and Business Services. Transfers of personnel budgets, transfers between function codes, and certain other District-level allocations require approval from Business Services.)
